  "description": "Shelbiette is a hero who gets trapped in a cave inside the dungeon with three intimidating monster kings. Although she's always been thirsty for some action, she never thought she'd be plowed mercilessly by an orc, a werewolf, and a goblin who all happen to be smoking hot. But thanks to a curse cast on the cave, the only way out is by taking all three for a spin. Can Shelbiette survive these brutal foursomes and make it out of the dungeon with her sanity intact? \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
